OL,3,GNEWSAFormer railway line named
OL,4,ABritain's favourite path
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn abandoned railway line which
OL,7,Fvolunteers transformed into a
OL,8,Fmuch-loved walking and cycling route
OL,9,Fhas been named Britain's favourite
OL,10,Fpath.
OL,12,FThe Strawberry Line path, near
OL,13,FWinscombe in North Somerset, was
OL,14,Fcrowned this year's winner by walking
OL,15,Fcharity The Ramblers following a
OL,16,Fmonth-long public vote.
OL,18,FThe winning path follows the route of a
OL,19,Fdisused Great Western Railway branch
OL,20,Fline which ran from Witham Junction to
OL,21,FYatton via Shepton Mallet, Wells and
OL,22,FCheddar.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
